### Read investor
GET http://localhost:8080/investor/bob

### Create investor
POST http://localhost:8080/investor/david
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "investorData": {
    "username": "david",
    "email": "bob@gmail.com",
    "firstname": "Bob",
    "lastname": "Eponge",
    "birthday": "2000-01-01"
  },
  "password": "Patrick"
}